@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@
+# Stage B verification
+
+Run the behavioral tests on an ordinary Linux test workstation (Bash, jq,
+coreutils, util-linux). No system nft or systemd state is changed:
+
+```sh
+timeout 90 bash tests/stageb/transaction-fixture.sh
+timeout 90 bash tests/fieldgate/tg7-backend-state-isolation.sh
+```
+
+The nft/service model is explicit. Its PASS proves control flow and file
+postconditions, **not** real kernel atomicity. Partial candidate-write faults
+are injected command failures, not evidence of real ENOSPC.
+
+On a **disposable Debian 12 / Ubuntu 22.04+ VM** with nftables, jq, util-linux
+and CAP_NET_ADMIN/CAP_SYS_ADMIN:
+
+```sh
+sudo timeout 150 bash tests/stageb/real-nft-validation.sh
+sudo timeout 150 bash tests/stagea/sa1-real-nft-validation.sh
+sudo timeout 180 bash tests/stagea/sa3-state-publication.sh
+sudo timeout 270 bash tests/stageb/real-systemd-validation.sh ./twebproxy-manager.sh --disposable-vm
+```
+
+The Stage B script first creates a separate network namespace. It refuses to
+run its inner phase in the parent's namespace. No host ruleset is flushed.
+The namespace vanishes at exit; all filesystem paths are temporary. Do not
+use a production VPS. The Stage A.1 state-publication test attempts a private
+tmpfs mount for genuine ENOSPC; no mock may replace its required result.
+
+Real nft tests include initial absence, atomic add/delete/recreate, a late
+batch error after delete, invalid syntax, idempotence, multiple/one/zero
+backends, real JSON verification, publication-failure rollback and an untouched
+foreign table. Service action selection and generated ExecStart/ExecReload
+execution are covered by the behavioral fixture. A real systemd lifecycle
+check is provided separately and requires the disposable VM; do not call that
+model a systemd test. The real systemd fixture creates a unique temporary unit
+in /run/systemd/system and assigns NetworkNamespacePath to its private netns.
+It checks start/reload, failed reload/restart preservation and non-destructive
+stop. The production service names and host nft namespace are never modified.
+
+Exit 77 / NOT_EXECUTED_ENVIRONMENT_LIMITATION means the required real check
+did not execute. It must never be counted as PASS.
